## ⚠️ CRITICAL: BTC-Only Files - DO NOT USE FOR BCH

### PSBT Files (BTC Only - BCH uses Raw TX Hex)

BCH does NOT support PSBT (Partially Signed Bitcoin Transaction, BIP174).
BCH uses Raw Transaction Hex format instead.

```
# Infrastructure Layer - PSBT Implementation
internal/infrastructure/api/btc/btc/psbt.go                    # ❌ NEVER use for BCH

# Use Case Layer - PSBT-based Transaction Flow
internal/application/usecase/watch/btc/create_transaction.go   # ⚠️ Uses PSBT - needs BCH override
internal/application/usecase/keygen/btc/sign_transaction.go    # ⚠️ Uses PSBT - needs BCH override
internal/application/usecase/sign/btc/sign_transaction.go      # ⚠️ Uses PSBT - needs BCH override
internal/application/usecase/watch/btc/send_transaction.go     # ⚠️ Uses PSBT - needs BCH override
```

