### DI Container Configuration

The DI container (`internal/di/container.go`) must inject the correct use case based on cointype:

```go
// For BTC cointype
watchusecase.NewCreateTransactionUseCase(btcClient, ...)  // Uses PSBT

// For BCH cointype
bchwatchusecase.NewCreateTransactionUseCase(bchClient, ...) // Uses Raw TX Hex
```

## BCH Signing Requirements

When signing BCH transactions, you MUST use:

```go
// BCH requires SIGHASH_FORKID (0x40) combined with sighash type
// SIGHASH_ALL (0x01) + SIGHASH_FORKID (0x40) = 0x41

const (
    SigHashAll     = 0x01
    SigHashForkID  = 0x40
    BCHSigHashType = SigHashAll | SigHashForkID  // 0x41
)
```

